#: ../../source/index.rst:5 2f445424bcb04d888b75c627290c312e
msgid "_`Introduction`"
msgstr "简介"

#: ../../source/index.rst:7 ef1339ae80b441f8ad83b1423614393a
msgid ""
"food_volume_measure is a C++17 library for point-cloud food volume "
"measurement on oven trays. It implements the PCD-IM (baseline-plane "
"height-difference integral) method with PCL: an empty-oven baseline is "
"discretized into a local-plane height map, the food cloud is voxel-"
"downsampled and clustered in the baseline plane, and per-cell height "
"differences are integrated into a volume in cubic centimeters."
msgstr ""
"food_volume_measure 是一个用于烤盘食材体积测量的 C++17 点云库。它基于 PCL 实现了 "
"PCD-IM（基准面高度差积分）方法：先将空炉基线离散为局部平面上的高度图，再对食物点云 "
"进行体素降采样并在基准面内聚类，最后将逐格高度差积分得到以立方厘米为单位的体积。"

#: ../../source/index.rst:14 7aa0e7b69da14a8b8d48abcacfd3ab45
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/index.rst:16 c84a4990ec5e40f7ac465faa408f16e4
msgid "Empty-oven baseline model with RANSAC plane fitting"
msgstr "基于 RANSAC 平面拟合的空炉基线模型"

#: ../../source/index.rst:17 7a43d5db11544867acfa333b6c95596b
msgid "Open3D-equivalent voxel downsampling and DBSCAN clustering"
msgstr "与 Open3D 等价的体素降采样与 DBSCAN 聚类"

#: ../../source/index.rst:18 808f5b27b7534e8ba129eba22ddb3953
msgid "Component-aware conservative hole completion"
msgstr "组件感知的保守补洞"

#: ../../source/index.rst:19 fd85e4508ad64fbcb49dc1d5cd3b2441
msgid "Reference volumes (AABB / OBB / convex hull)"
msgstr "参考体积（AABB / OBB / 凸包）"

#: ../../source/index.rst:20 13ef126de94d49fdbce764b43e09557e
msgid "PCD loading via ``load_pcd``"
msgstr "通过 ``load_pcd`` 载入 PCD"

#: ../../source/index.rst:21 a431e9aa56b44501ba3f37e9dde03e52
msgid ""
"Host-only point-cloud processing (PCL); bare-metal stubs report an "
"unsupported status"
msgstr "仅宿主机点云处理（PCL）；裸机桩返回不支持状态"

